@remove_czarzasty
title: Remove Włodzimierz Czarzasty
subtitle: The SLD apparatus loses weight and becomes more restless.
view-if: czarzasty_advisor = 1
choose-if: leadership_reshuffle_timer <= 0 and n_advisors > 0
unavailable-subtitle: The bureau cannot be changed now.
on-arrival: czarzasty_advisor = 0; n_advisors -= 1; advisor_reshuffle_removed_czarzasty = 1; removed_advisor = "Włodzimierz Czarzasty"; barons_strength -= 2; barons_dissent += 4
go-to: poland_manage_advisors

